#
# Build-context filter for CubeTemplateCenter/docker/Dockerfile
# (context = repository root).
#
# The repo-root .dockerignore is tailored to docker/Dockerfile.builder and would
# exclude CubeTemplateCenter/ without these overrides. CubeTemplateCenter's
# go.mod replaces the local CubeMaster, CubeDB, Cubelet and cubelog modules via
# ../CubeMaster, ../CubeDB, ../Cubelet and ../cubelog, so the image build must
# include all five directories.
**
!CubeTemplateCenter
!CubeTemplateCenter/**
!CubeMaster
!CubeMaster/**
!cubelog
!cubelog/**
!CubeDB
!CubeDB/**
!Cubelet
!Cubelet/**
